<template><div class="app-container"><h1>经营报表</h1><p>按下单日期统计（北京时间）。实收为已支付金额减已批准退款，包含正在履约的订单；热销金额为商品原价，不分摊优惠或配送费。</p><el-date-picker v-model="dates" type="daterange" value-format="YYYY-MM-DD" start-placeholder="开始日期" end-placeholder="结束日期" :clearable="false"/><el-button type="primary" :loading="loading" @click="load">查询</el-button><el-button :loading="exporting" @click="download">导出每日订单 CSV</el-button><el-row :gutter="16" style="margin:24px -8px"><el-col v-for="c in cards" :key="c.label" :xs="12" :sm="8" :lg="4"><el-card shadow="never"><div>{{c.label}}</div><h2>{{c.value}}</h2></el-card></el-col></el-row><h3>每日经营</h3><el-table :data="data.daily" v-loading="loading"><el-table-column prop="day" label="日期"/><el-table-column prop="orders" label="订单数"/><el-table-column label="支付金额"><template #default="{row}">¥{{money(row.gross)}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="退款金额"><template #default="{row}">¥{{money(row.refunds)}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="实收"><template #default="{row}">¥{{money(row.revenue)}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="cancelled" label="取消数"/><el-table-column prop="refunded" label="退款数"/></el-table><h3>热销菜品 · 前20名</h3><el-table :data="data.popular"><el-table-column type="index" label="排名"/><el-table-column prop="name" label="菜品"/><el-table-column prop="quantity" label="销售份数"/><el-table-column label="商品金额"><template #default="{row}">¥{{money(row.sales)}}</template></el-table-column></el-table><p>每次可查询最多31天，导出最多10000单。商家仅能查看自己的经营数据；取消率为未支付取消数 ÷ 总订单数，退款单独统计。</p></div></template>
<script setup>
import {ref,computed,onMounted} from 'vue';import {foodGet,money,statuses} from '@/api/food';import {serializeCsv} from '../csv';import {ElMessage} from 'element-plus';
const today=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('sv-SE',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai'}).format(new Date()),dates=ref([today,today]),data=ref({summary:{},daily:[],popular:[]}),loading=ref(false),exporting=ref(false);let revision=0;
const cards=computed(()=>{const s=data.value.summary;return [{label:'实收营业额',value:'¥'+money(s.revenue)},{label:'支付金额',value:'¥'+money(s.gross)},{label:'退款金额',value:'¥'+money(s.refunds)},{label:'订单总数',value:s.orders||0},{label:'退款订单',value:s.refunded||0},{label:'取消率',value:(s.cancelRate||0)+'%'}]});
function range(){if(dates.value?.length!==2)throw Error('请选择日期范围');return {from:dates.value[0],to:dates.value[1]}}async function load(){const ticket=++revision;loading.value=true;try{const r=await foodGet('/reports',range());if(ticket===revision)data.value=r.data}finally{if(ticket===revision)loading.value=false}}
async function download(){exporting.value=true;try{const query=range(),rows=(await foodGet('/reports/export',query)).data;const safe=v=>{const s=String(v??'');return /^[\s]*[=+@-]/.test(s)?"'"+s:s};const csv=serializeCsv([['订单编号','商家','方式','状态','售后状态','商品金额(元)','优惠(元)','配送费(元)','实付(元)','下单时间','预约时间'],...rows.map(r=>[safe(r.id),safe(r.store_name),r.type==='PICKUP'?'自取':'外卖',statuses[r.status],r.refund_status,money(r.subtotal),money(r.discount),money(r.delivery_fee),money(r.total),r.created_at,r.scheduled_at||''])]);const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob(['\uFEFF'+csv],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=`经营订单_${query.from}_${query.to}.csv`;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);ElMessage.success('已导出 '+rows.length+' 条订单')}finally{exporting.value=false}}onMounted(load);
</script>
